            <p>Personality development club was established from June 2022 in the ECE department. It focuses on the personality development of an individual. Personality development helps one to gain confidence and high self-esteem helps to develop a positive attitude in life and helps an individual to inculcate positive qualities like punctualities flexible attitude, willing ness to learn, friendly nature and eagerness to help others. It has a positive impact on one's communication skill and the way they see the world.  </p>
           
